# Generated native directories (managed Expo workflow)
# IMPORTANT: anchor to root so unanchored `ios/` / `android/` patterns do NOT
# match `modules/mood-*/ios/` and strip our local Swift sources during
# expo prebuild / EAS uploads.
/ios/
/android/
package-lock.json
